    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/11f7424697f85e9786ce83f4f61fb8e5.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/11f7424697f85e9786ce83f4f61fb8e5.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/11f7424697f85e9786ce83f4f61fb8e5.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKINROT</strong> is a psychological survival horror murder investigation game that puts you in the shoes of <strong>John Charleson</strong>, an experienced private detective tasked with investigating an abandoned home rumored to be the lair of a cannibalistic serial killer and taxidermist, known as <strong>The Flesh Weaver</strong> by the local town of <strong>Pineville</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When John receives a call and distress signal from a satellite phone, he must act quickly to save his fellow detective, <strong>Max</strong>, before it\u2019s too late. Within the estate, John uncovers nightmarish secrets that threaten to tear at the very fabric of his sanity.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/820b9347efa8799d47c5179da6ad2295.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/820b9347efa8799d47c5179da6ad2295.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/820b9347efa8799d47c5179da6ad2295.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKINROT</strong> is\u00a0inspired by movies such as Silence of the lambs &amp; Texas chainsaw massacre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Hide. Survive by all means or you will become yet another trophy and abomination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/a30a7c7d7eba12a3a523382e4766242a.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/a30a7c7d7eba12a3a523382e4766242a.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/a30a7c7d7eba12a3a523382e4766242a.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grimly Immersive Environment:\u00a0</strong> Roam a decaying home where every detail breathes with a sense of decay. Search for clues hidden within the home of a twisted cannibal, taxidermist serial killer known as the flesh weaver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Audio Design:\u00a0</strong> Immerse yourself\u00a0with cutting edge 3D audio, including a dynamic randomized sound system that uses binaural surround sound as well as a randomized thunder system.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat:\u00a0</strong> Protect yourself against various monstrosities and human experiments that roam the decaying home, use an arsenal of weapons to save your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:\u00a0</strong> Solve various puzzles involving human remains\u00a0and combine clues to unlock the haunting truth behind the house\u2019s sinister history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Grotesque Themed Horror:\u00a0</strong>\u00a0A gruesome homicide investigation into the abandoned home will shake you to your core with it's brutality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/e308ed05490be3be0ecaa1dbdab94383.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/e308ed05490be3be0ecaa1dbdab94383.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/e308ed05490be3be0ecaa1dbdab94383.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/11f7424697f85e9786ce83f4f61fb8e5.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/11f7424697f85e9786ce83f4f61fb8e5.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/11f7424697f85e9786ce83f4f61fb8e5.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKINROT</strong> is a psychological survival horror murder investigation game that puts you in the shoes of <strong>John Charleson</strong>, an experienced private detective tasked with investigating an abandoned home rumored to be the lair of a cannibalistic serial killer and taxidermist, known as <strong>The Flesh Weaver</strong> by the local town of <strong>Pineville</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When John receives a call and distress signal from a satellite phone, he must act quickly to save his fellow detective, <strong>Max</strong>, before it\u2019s too late. Within the estate, John uncovers nightmarish secrets that threaten to tear at the very fabric of his sanity.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/820b9347efa8799d47c5179da6ad2295.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/820b9347efa8799d47c5179da6ad2295.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/820b9347efa8799d47c5179da6ad2295.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKINROT</strong> is\u00a0inspired by movies such as Silence of the lambs &amp; Texas chainsaw massacre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Hide. Survive by all means or you will become yet another trophy and abomination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/a30a7c7d7eba12a3a523382e4766242a.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/a30a7c7d7eba12a3a523382e4766242a.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/a30a7c7d7eba12a3a523382e4766242a.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grimly Immersive Environment:\u00a0</strong> Roam a decaying home where every detail breathes with a sense of decay. Search for clues hidden within the home of a twisted cannibal, taxidermist serial killer known as the flesh weaver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Audio Design:\u00a0</strong> Immerse yourself\u00a0with cutting edge 3D audio, including a dynamic randomized sound system that uses binaural surround sound as well as a randomized thunder system.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat:\u00a0</strong> Protect yourself against various monstrosities and human experiments that roam the decaying home, use an arsenal of weapons to save your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:\u00a0</strong> Solve various puzzles involving human remains\u00a0and combine clues to unlock the haunting truth behind the house\u2019s sinister history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Grotesque Themed Horror:\u00a0</strong>\u00a0A gruesome homicide investigation into the abandoned home will shake you to your core with it's brutality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/e308ed05490be3be0ecaa1dbdab94383.poster.avif?t=1754476145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/e308ed05490be3be0ecaa1dbdab94383.webm?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756320/extras/e308ed05490be3be0ecaa1dbdab94383.mp4?t=1754476145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "SKINROT is a psychological survival horror game. Detective John Charleson's partner Max has gone missing, now you must enter the lair of the Flesh Weaver, a cannibalistic taxidermist and serial killer. Follow the signal, save the town of Pineville and find Max. Before you're stitched into the rot.",
